{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>Do not fear, for I am with you.</b> Because Avimelekh had driven him away from him out of their jealousy toward him, and moreover the shepherds of Gerar had become numerous against him, he feared lest they gather against him and strike him and his household. The Holy One, blessed be He, reassured him that he should not fear them, and He blessed him. Then He placed in their hearts, so that the king went before him with greater honor than he had shown his father, for he came with Pikhol, commander of his army, and furthermore added to bring with him many of his friends:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:35:30.185150942Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}